    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>A free-to-play turn based RPG that serves as a short demo. It is a fair gauge if you as a player may or may not want to pick up the full games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story is a short series of quests to help Anri recover an artifact.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet interesting people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about your party members and the region you are exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and fight challenging turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable dungeons with harvesting and chest nodes that reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fun mini games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food and cook it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with widescreen monitors and laptops in mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the base game, we have the following DLCs available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization DLCs: a free download for Luminous Skies: A Short Adventure and one for Interstellar and it is intended to be used on lower end operating systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The other DLCs are are effectively 2 games and 1 big expansion pack in a trench coat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: The Pilgrimage: A standalone game set prior to the events in A Short Adventure and Horizons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: Horizons: an add-on for A Short Adventure. It adds a many new quests, new encounters, new overworld zones, secrets, weapons and armors, and new party members. We hope to add additional content on a regular basis. Mainland and new world access has opened up for more exploration. If The Pilgrimage is a standalone game, Horizons is a standalone expansion pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: Interstellar. Another standalone game, this time set in a Sci-Fi setting. Explore many worlds and contend with the Solar Regime and their plots to conquer all of known space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to our announcements in the community section for further details on updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some ways, these games have more in common with games of the 1980s or 1990s than those of the current year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? It's all out there for you to find and experience for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not use A.I. in our products.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>A free-to-play turn based RPG that serves as a short demo. It is a fair gauge if you as a player may or may not want to pick up the full games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story is a short series of quests to help Anri recover an artifact.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet interesting people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about your party members and the region you are exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and fight challenging turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable dungeons with harvesting and chest nodes that reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fun mini games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food and cook it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with widescreen monitors and laptops in mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the base game, we have the following DLCs available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization DLCs: a free download for Luminous Skies: A Short Adventure and one for Interstellar and it is intended to be used on lower end operating systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The other DLCs are are effectively 2 games and 1 big expansion pack in a trench coat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: The Pilgrimage: A standalone game set prior to the events in A Short Adventure and Horizons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: Horizons: an add-on for A Short Adventure. It adds a many new quests, new encounters, new overworld zones, secrets, weapons and armors, and new party members. We hope to add additional content on a regular basis. Mainland and new world access has opened up for more exploration. If The Pilgrimage is a standalone game, Horizons is a standalone expansion pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminous Skies: Interstellar. Another standalone game, this time set in a Sci-Fi setting. Explore many worlds and contend with the Solar Regime and their plots to conquer all of known space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to our announcements in the community section for further details on updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some ways, these games have more in common with games of the 1980s or 1990s than those of the current year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? It's all out there for you to find and experience for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not use A.I. in our products.</p>",
    "short_description": "A free-to-play demo for a turn based RPG. Explore the world and fight challenging battles. Play fun mini games. Gather food and cook it.",
